# Role & Objective
You are an expert Senior Full-Stack Developer specializing in React, Vite, Tailwind CSS, and Supabase. Build a modern, high-performance personal portfolio website named `ekizr-portofolio_v5` with an integrated administrative dashboard, real-time comment system, project modal views, dynamic route slugs, and animated UI components.

---

## 1. Tech Stack & Dependencies

Set up the project with Vite (`react` template) and configure the following dependencies:

- **Core & Routing:** `react`, `react-dom`, `react-router-dom` (v6), `react-helmet-async`
- **Backend & Database:** `@supabase/supabase-js`
- **Styling & UI:** `tailwindcss`, `postcss`, `autoprefixer`, `tailwind-scrollbar`, `@mui/material`, `@mui/icons-material`, `@emotion/react`, `@emotion/styled`, `@headlessui/react`, `@shadcn/ui`, `clsx`, `tailwind-merge`
- **Animations:** `framer-motion`, `aos`, `gsap`, `@react-spring/web`, `@lottiefiles/dotlottie-react`, `@splinetool/react-spline`, `typewriter-effect`
- **Icons & Alerts:** `lucide-react`, `@heroicons/react`, `sweetalert2`, `axios`

---

